      "description": "The practice of getting a brand named, cited and recommended inside AI-generated answers from engines like ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini and Google AI Overviews — as opposed to ranking inside a list of blue links.",
      "url": "{{ _canonical }}",
